@host = http://localhost:8080

### 1) Utente proprietario della bacheca
# @name proprietario
POST {{host}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "propmembri", "email": "propmembri@example.com", "password": "password123" }

### 2) Un utente da aggiungere come membro
# @name membro
POST {{host}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "membro1", "email": "membro1@example.com", "password": "password123" }

### 3) Bacheca
# @name bacheca
POST {{host}}/api/boards
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Bacheca condivisa", "ownerId": {{proprietario.response.body.id}} }

### 4) Elenco membri iniziale -> lista vuota []
GET {{host}}/api/boards/{{bacheca.response.body.id}}/members

### 5) Aggiungi il membro -> 201, roleOnBoard MEMBER
# @name aggiunta
POST {{host}}/api/boards/{{bacheca.response.body.id}}/members
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": {{membro.response.body.id}} }

### 6) Elenco membri -> ora contiene un membro
GET {{host}}/api/boards/{{bacheca.response.body.id}}/members

### 7) (doppione) stesso utente, stessa bacheca -> deve dare 409
POST {{host}}/api/boards/{{bacheca.response.body.id}}/members
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": {{membro.response.body.id}} }

### 8) (errore) utente inesistente -> 404
POST {{host}}/api/boards/{{bacheca.response.body.id}}/members
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 999999 }

### 9) (errore) userId mancante -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/boards/{{bacheca.response.body.id}}/members
Content-Type: application/json

{ }

### 10) (errore) membri di bacheca inesistente -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/boards/999999/members

### 11) Rimuovi il membro -> 204 No Content
DELETE {{host}}/api/boards/{{bacheca.response.body.id}}/members/{{membro.response.body.id}}

### 12) Elenco membri -> di nuovo vuoto []
GET {{host}}/api/boards/{{bacheca.response.body.id}}/members

### 13) (errore) rimuovere un membro non iscritto -> 404
DELETE {{host}}/api/boards/{{bacheca.response.body.id}}/members/{{membro.response.body.id}}